mily: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 Miyoo <span style=\"color: #9333ea;\">Mini Plus</span>\n</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">Compact Retro Console \u2022 3.5\" IPS \u2022 OnionOS \u2022 Wi\u2011Fi Multiplayer</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #111827; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Colors</strong><br>Grey / Transparent Purple / White / Transparent Black</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display</strong><br>3.5\" IPS screen<br>640 \u00d7 480 resolution<br>Narrow bezel, high screen\u2011to\u2011body ratio</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>ARM Cortex\u2011A7 @ 1.2 GHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>128 MB DDR3</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>TF / MicroSD card<br>Expandable up to 256 GB</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Operating System</strong><br>OnionOS / Linux</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Emulation Support</strong><br>Multiple open\u2011source emulators<br>Based on RetroArch</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Multiplayer &amp; RTC</strong><br>Wi\u2011Fi battle support<br>Real\u2011Time Clock (RTC)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Game Features</strong><br>Online multiplayer<br>Instant save/load states<br>10 save slots per emulator</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>System Customization</strong><br>Key mapping \u2022 Language \u2022 Sleep<br>Background music \u2022 One\u2011click restore</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Battery</strong><br>3000 mAh Li\u2011ion battery<br>5\u20136 hours gameplay</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Charging</strong><br>USB Type\u2011C \u2022 5V / 1A</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Material</strong><br>ABS plastic + electronic components</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Dimensions</strong><br>108 \u00d7 78.5 \u00d7 22 mm</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">Ultra\u2011compact \u2022 OnionOS power \u2022 Wi\u2011Fi multiplayer</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary by configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
